---
// The favicon's current joins the words: it leaves the top of the n at x-height and lands on the baseline
// before the t. It is two true circular arcs of equal radius meeting at the midpoint, level at both ends:
// R = (w² + h²) / 4h = (800² + 504²) / 2016 = 443.46, so each arc turns 64.4°.
// The path is drawn in thousandths of an em, so it scales with the brand's font size.
---
<a href="/" class="brand" aria-label="Open Tributary home"><span>open</span><svg class="brand-current" viewBox="0 0 800 504" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M0 0A443.46 443.46 0 0 1 400 252A443.46 443.46 0 0 0 800 504" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke"/></svg><span>tributary</span></a>
